### Part 3 — Intent Verification

Goal: prevent stale leftover `bashir-heartbeat.json` from insta-aborting Bashir at gate spawn. The fix writes a fresh ts immediately after `execFile` and before `setInterval`, so the first poll tick (+30s) reads a stamp that is ≤30s old — well below the 90s stale threshold. Bashir now has the full 90s window to take over writing heartbeats. Intent fully achieved.

### Part 4 — Scope Discipline

Three files changed:
- `bridge/orchestrator.js` — the specified target. In scope.
- `test/gate-heartbeat-reset-on-spawn.test.js` — the specified test file. In scope.
- `bridge/queue/309-DONE.md` — required queue artifact (protocol). In scope.

No out-of-scope changes.
